# The site's preview build only (`npm run deploy:site-preview`, Vite's
# "preview" mode, which also reads .env.production): sign-in, against the
# accounts Worker in accounts-worker/, before accounts are released. The
# production build has no accounts address, so baheardle.com shows no
# sign-in. Not a secret.
VITE_ACCOUNTS_URL=https://ba-heardle-accounts.shinrunner1st.workers.dev
